text:'{"blocks":[{"key":"1fnfo","text":"Demedts et al. clarify that math anxiety (MA) is a domain-specific form of anxiety, distinct from general anxiety (GA). While GA pertains to a broad tendency to experience anxiety across various situations, MA is specifically triggered by mathematical tasks and contexts. ","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":272,"style":"textHighlightEnable:false"},{"offset":0,"length":272,"style":"overridden:true"},{"offset":0,"length":272,"style":"textShadowEnable:false"},{"offset":0,"length":272,"style":"hlnk:"},{"offset":0,"length":272,"style":"defaultBackgroundColor:#E8D01B"},{"offset":0,"length":272,"style":"hlnkt:wp"},{"offset":0,"length":272,"style":"textOutlineEnable:false"},{"offset":0,"length":272,"style":"opacity:1"},{"offset":0,"length":272,"style":"fontFamily:Lexend"},{"offset":0,"length":272,"style":"hlnke:true"},{"offset":0,"length":272,"style":"backgroundColor:unset"},{"offset":0,"length":272,"style":"fontType:regular"},{"offset":51,"length":15,"style":"borderBottomStyle:solid"},{"offset":0,"length":272,"style":"color:#263a2b"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{"listType":"S_Bullets08","listColor":"#666666","listIndent":"100%","listSize":"100%","listDepth":"0","overridden":"true","presetId":"text-body-3"}},{"key":"1t84m","text":"","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{"listType":"S_Bullets08","listColor":"#666666","listIndent":"100%","listSize":"100%","listDepth":"0","overridden":"true","presetId":"text-body-3"}},{"key":"4ihs9","text":"Their research indicates that MA can predict performance in math-related tasks, whereas GA does not have the same predictive value. This distinction shows the importance of targeted interventions that address the specific challenges of MA to effectively support students struggling with math-related anxiety.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":308,"style":"color:#263a2b"},{"offset":0,"length":308,"style":"hlnkt:wp"},{"offset":0,"length":308,"style":"textOutlineEnable:false"},{"offset":0,"length":308,"style":"opacity:1"},{"offset":0,"length":308,"style":"fontFamily:Lexend"},{"offset":0,"length":308,"style":"hlnke:true"},{"offset":0,"length":308,"style":"backgroundColor:unset"},{"offset":0,"length":308,"style":"fontType:regular"},{"offset":0,"length":308,"style":"defaultBackgroundColor:#E8D01B"},{"offset":0,"length":308,"style":"textHighlightEnable:false"},{"offset":0,"length":308,"style":"overridden:true"},{"offset":0,"length":308,"style":"textShadowEnable:false"},{"offset":0,"length":308,"style":"hlnk:"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{"listType":"S_Bullets08","listColor":"#666666","listIndent":"100%","listSize":"100%","listDepth":"0","overridden":"true","presetId":"text-body-3"}}],"entityMap":{}}',
